     A          R PXT01                     TEXT('EDI EXTRACT WORKFILE')
     A            XTCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            XTFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            XTFYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
     A            XTCASE    R               REFFLD(CASE)
     A            XTTSET         3A         COLHDG('TRANSACTION' 'SET ID')
     A            XTSORT    R               REFFLD(NAME)
     A                                      COLHDG('SORT FIELD')
     A            XTDUE     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('SUBMISSION DUE DATE')
     A            XTADJ     R               REFFLD(NAME)
     A                                      COLHDG('ADJUSTER NAME')
     A            XTCLNM    R               REFFLD(NAME)
     A                                      COLHDG('CLAIMANT NAME')
     A*
     A            XTUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            XTPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            XTTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            XTDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
     A*** BEG ADD ***** 03/21/97 **************************************
     A            XTEMP#    R               REFFLD(EMP#)
     A            XTDIV     R               REFFLD(DIV)
     A            XTNAME    R               REFFLD(NAME)
     A            XTCOM3    R               REFFLD(DS15)
     A                                      COLHDG('RISK ID#')
